        "text": "You are an expert data extraction assistant. Analyze the provided file and extract the required information into a single JSON object.\n\n### Instructions:\n1. Check whether the \"MAIL PACK\" option/checkbox is ticked.\n2. If \"MAIL PACK\" is NOT ticked:\n   - Set \"mail_pack_is_ticked\" to false.\n   - Set all other fields (\"client\", \"contact_number\", \"lead_source\", \"address\") to null.\n3. If \"MAIL PACK\" IS ticked:\n   - Set \"mail_pack_is_ticked\" to true.\n   - Extract \"client\", \"contact_number\", \"lead_source\", and \"address\" values from the file.\n\n### Expected JSON Output Schema:\n{\n  \"client\": \"string or null\",\n  \"contact_number\": \"string or null\",\n  \"lead_source\": \"outbound | inbound | null\",\n  \"address\": \"string or null\",\n  \"mail_pack_is_ticked\": boolean\n}\n\n### Strict Formatting Rules:\n- Return ONLY valid JSON. Do NOT wrap in markdown fences (no ```json), and do NOT include intro or outro text.\n- Standardize \"lead_source\" to strictly lowercase: \"outbound\", \"inbound\", or null.\n- Standardize \"contact_number\" as a clean string (digits and standard phone formatting only, or null if missing).\n- If any value cannot be clearly identified or is missing, set its value to null.",
